< \begin{tabular}{|p{1.25cm}|p{1.25cm}|p{1.25cm}|p{1.25cm}|p{1.25cm}|p{1.25cm}|p{1.25cm}|p{1.25cm}|}
< 	\hline
< 	 & &  & X & N & Z & V & C\\
< 	\hline
< \end{tabular}
< \end{center}
< 
< 	\bi
< 		\ite C \pr Carry flag (set if a carry out of the most significant bit of the operand occurs for an addition,or if a borrow occurs in a subtraction; otherwise cleared)
< 		\ite V \pr Overflow flag (set if an arithmetic overflow occurs implying that the result cannot be represented in the operand size; otherwise cleared)
< 		\ite Z \pr Zero flag (set if the result equals zero; otherwise cleared)
< 		\ite N \pr Negative flag (set if the most significant bit of the result is set; otherwise cleared)
< 		\ite X \pr Extend flag (set to the value of the C-bit for arithmetic operations; otherwise not affected or set to a specified result)
